{"id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#prop:dc-ch3-2-9","title":"prop:dc-ch3-2-9","path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods.md","line":386,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods.tex#prop:dc-ch3-2-9","uses":["[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#def:dc-ch3-expmap]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-expmap-ray]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-dexp]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-strict]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c1ball]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c1]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-invertible]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c1diffeo]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c2ball]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c2diffeo]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-cinfty]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods.tex","label":"prop:dc-ch3-2-9","line":1073,"source":"\\begin{proposition}[exp_q is a local diffeomorphism]\n  \\label{prop:dc-ch3-2-9}\n\n  \\uses{def:dc-ch3-expmap, lem:dc-ch3-expmap-ray, lem:dc-ch3-2-9-dexp, lem:dc-ch3-2-9-strict, lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c1ball, lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c1, lem:dc-ch3-2-9-invertible, lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c1diffeo, lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c2ball, lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c2diffeo, lem:dc-ch3-2-9-cinfty}\n\n  \\dcref{ch3:2.9}\n\n  Given $q\\in M$, there exists $\\varepsilon>0$ such that\n  $\\exp_q:B_\\varepsilon(0)\\subset T_qM\\to M$ is a diffeomorphism of\n  $B_\\varepsilon(0)$ onto an open subset of $M$.\n\\end{proposition}\n\\begin{proof}\n  \\sketch\n  Compute $d(\\exp_q)_0$:\n\n  $$\n  d(\\exp_q)_0(v)=\\frac{d}{dt}\\big(\\exp_q(tv)\\big)\\Big|_{t=0}=\\frac{d}{dt}\\big(\\gamma(1,q,tv)\\big)\\Big|_{t=0}=\\frac{d}{dt}\\big(\\gamma(t,q,v)\\big)\\Big|_{t=0}=v.\n  $$\n\n  Hence $d(\\exp_q)_0=\\mathrm{Id}$ on $T_qM$, and by the inverse function theorem\n  $\\exp_q$ is a local diffeomorphism on a neighborhood of $0$.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proposition</div></section>[exp_q is a local diffeomorphism] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-70726f703a64632d6368332d322d39\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods%23def%3Adc-ch3-expmap\">↗ def:dc-ch3-expmap</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods%23lem%3Adc-ch3-expmap-ray\">↗ lem:dc-ch3-expmap-ray</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods%23lem%3Adc-ch3-2-9-dexp\">↗ lem:dc-ch3-2-9-dexp</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods%23lem%3Adc-ch3-2-9-strict\">↗ lem:dc-ch3-2-9-strict</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods%23lem%3Adc-ch3-2-9-c1ball\">↗ lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c1ball</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods%23lem%3Adc-ch3-2-9-c1\">↗ lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c1</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods%23lem%3Adc-ch3-2-9-invertible\">↗ lem:dc-ch3-2-9-invertible</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods%23lem%3Adc-ch3-2-9-c1diffeo\">↗ lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c1diffeo</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods%23lem%3Adc-ch3-2-9-c2ball\">↗ lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c2ball</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods%23lem%3Adc-ch3-2-9-c2diffeo\">↗ lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c2diffeo</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods%23lem%3Adc-ch3-2-9-cinfty\">↗ lem:dc-ch3-2-9-cinfty</a> <p></p><span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch3:2.9</span></span><p></p>Given <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$q\\in M$\">$q\\in M$</span>, there exists <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\varepsilon &gt;0$\">$\\varepsilon &gt;0$</span> such that <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\exp _q:B_\\varepsilon (0)\\subset T_qM\\to M$\">$\\exp _q:B_\\varepsilon (0)\\subset T_qM\\to M$</span> is a diffeomorphism of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$B_\\varepsilon (0)$\">$B_\\varepsilon (0)$</span> onto an open subset of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$M$\">$M$</span>.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p>\\sketch Compute <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$d(\\exp _q)_0$\">$d(\\exp _q)_0$</span>: </p><p><span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  d(\\exp _q)_0(v)=\\frac{d}{dt}\\big(\\exp _q(tv)\\big)\\Big|_{t=0}=\\frac{d}{dt}\\big(\\gamma (1,q,tv)\\big)\\Big|_{t=0}=\\frac{d}{dt}\\big(\\gamma (t,q,v)\\big)\\Big|_{t=0}=v.  \\]\">\\[  d(\\exp _q)_0(v)=\\frac{d}{dt}\\big(\\exp _q(tv)\\big)\\Big|_{t=0}=\\frac{d}{dt}\\big(\\gamma (1,q,tv)\\big)\\Big|_{t=0}=\\frac{d}{dt}\\big(\\gamma (t,q,v)\\big)\\Big|_{t=0}=v.  \\]</span></p><p>Hence <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$d(\\exp _q)_0=\\mathrm{Id}$\">$d(\\exp _q)_0=\\mathrm{Id}$</span> on <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$T_qM$\">$T_qM$</span>, and by the inverse function theorem <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\exp _q$\">$\\exp _q$</span> is a local diffeomorphism on a neighborhood of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$0$\">$0$</span>. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c2diffeo","next":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#ex:dc-ch3-2-10","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#def:dc-ch3-expmap","title":"def:dc-ch3-expmap","label":"def:dc-ch3-expmap"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-expmap-ray","title":"lem:dc-ch3-expmap-ray","label":"lem:dc-ch3-expmap-ray"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-dexp","title":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-dexp","label":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-dexp"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-strict","title":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-strict","label":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-strict"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c1ball","title":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c1ball","label":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c1ball"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c1","title":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c1","label":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c1"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-invertible","title":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-invertible","label":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-invertible"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c1diffeo","title":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c1diffeo","label":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c1diffeo"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c2ball","title":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c2ball","label":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c2ball"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c2diffeo","title":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c2diffeo","label":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c2diffeo"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-cinfty","title":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-cinfty","label":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-cinfty"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#prop:dc-ch3-3-6","title":"prop:dc-ch3-3-6","label":"prop:dc-ch3-3-6"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-4-2-propagation","title":"lem:dc-ch8-4-2-propagation","label":"lem:dc-ch8-4-2-propagation"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#prop:dc-ch3-2-9","title":"prop:dc-ch3-2-9","tex":"\\begin{proposition}[exp_q is a local diffeomorphism]\n  \\label{prop:dc-ch3-2-9}\n\n  \\uses{def:dc-ch3-expmap, lem:dc-ch3-expmap-ray, lem:dc-ch3-2-9-dexp, lem:dc-ch3-2-9-strict, lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c1ball, lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c1, lem:dc-ch3-2-9-invertible, lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c1diffeo, lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c2ball, lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c2diffeo, lem:dc-ch3-2-9-cinfty}\n\n  \\dcref{ch3:2.9}\n\n  Given $q\\in M$, there exists $\\varepsilon>0$ such that\n  $\\exp_q:B_\\varepsilon(0)\\subset T_qM\\to M$ is a diffeomorphism of\n  $B_\\varepsilon(0)$ onto an open subset of $M$.\n\\end{proposition}\n\\begin{proof}\n  \\sketch\n  Compute $d(\\exp_q)_0$:\n\n  $$\n  d(\\exp_q)_0(v)=\\frac{d}{dt}\\big(\\exp_q(tv)\\big)\\Big|_{t=0}=\\frac{d}{dt}\\big(\\gamma(1,q,tv)\\big)\\Big|_{t=0}=\\frac{d}{dt}\\big(\\gamma(t,q,v)\\big)\\Big|_{t=0}=v.\n  $$\n\n  Hence $d(\\exp_q)_0=\\mathrm{Id}$ on $T_qM$, and by the inverse function theorem\n  $\\exp_q$ is a local diffeomorphism on a neighborhood of $0$.\n\\end{proof}","source":"tex/references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#def:dc-ch3-expmap","title":"def:dc-ch3-expmap","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-expmap-ray","title":"lem:dc-ch3-expmap-ray","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-dexp","title":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-dexp","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-strict","title":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-strict","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c1ball","title":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c1ball","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c1","title":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c1","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-invertible","title":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-invertible","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c1diffeo","title":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c1diffeo","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c2ball","title":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c2ball","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c2diffeo","title":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-c2diffeo","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-cinfty","title":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-cinfty","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}